  "releaseNotes": "- Allows switching among an Agent version's permitted models between completed turns in the web product and SDK; keeps running turns, approvals and questions on their original model\n- Preserves native conversation history across model changes and compacts with the previous model before moving to a smaller input budget or different protocol; bounds stalled native compaction\n- Adds per-Provider/model reasoning-effort configuration, exposes only declared levels, and preserves explicit upstream defaults through Run admission, Gateway conversion, lease renewal and recovery\n- Recovers signed update-manifest checks through the official GitHub Contents API when the primary download path fails\n- Ships Runtime `1.0.0` with matching Gateway and Codex/OpenCode bridges; preserves configuration, conversations, workspace files, attachments and Skills",
